56,-0.07243142,-0.04737207,0.05302118,0.05146309,-0.00286927,-0.01350995,0.04690482,-0.01263288,-0.0079908,0.03061191,-0.02790135,-0.01712174,-0.02093521,0.02106558,0.03409873,0.00748672,-0.07641095,-0.0156762,-0.00454592,-0.00689476,-0.0209173,-0.05751008,-0.02120034,-0.02107234,-0.03323793,-0.06838798,0.03241259,0.05144842,-0.02316315,0.01801286,0.01527434,-0.05284457,-0.03410481,0.00978798,-0.00445233,0.1289008,0.01041445,0.00506472,-0.02751249,-0.10069788,0.02006274,-0.04191312,-0.04275116,0.08427801,0.02713574,-0.04308075,0.05631163,0.08475085,0.00019846,-0.04248347,0.01752582,-0.03266741,0.07704902,0.07419249,0.04353694,0.02414088,-0.00526271,-0.0348975,-0.21391028,0.0112576,-0.01359753,0.05173943,0.00059359,0.00429883,0.0675682,-0.0217869,-0.01429047,0.01307771,0.13192329,-0.04273191,-0.00022392,0.01789077,-0.05762729,0.0169033,0.02234863,-0.02372603,-0.048616,0.04060123,0.02761406,-0.02397897,0.01883401,-0.01862902,0.02281091,0.0179693,0.10779527,0.01952859,0.04441511,-0.01825355,0.07385387,0.06904618,-0.01605036,-0.14622189,-0.00199565,0.04472042,0.030391,0.00820763,0.03781557,-0.01358094,0.00176558,0.09007712,-0.00512836,-0.08350693,0.01942268,-0.07650941,-0.00711829,0.02386712,-0.10483067,-0.05073301,0.009783,0.04343495,-0.01017208,-0.01435994,0.05115009,-0.05731338,-0.04999383,0.04163638,-0.04094959,0.04627541,0.03460942,-0.00179391,-0.00482173,-0.03201319,0.02464806,-0.03919394,-0.02276671,-0.04229767,0.04826439,-0.0461883,0.05146255,0.09104756,-0.0017525,0.03538553,0.03561869,-0.01794578,-0.00099024,-0.04943886,-0.04018236,-0.05902898,-0.00651495,-0.03454209,0.06278973,0.03227522,-0.00202108,0.044766,0.00500664,-0.03407329,0.0367699,0.00167085,0.01801597,0.00267204,-0.06193699,-0.01773096,0.05236723,0.00763188,-0.29839361,0.01796427,0.07833181,-0.00122692,-0.0594354,-0.02872529,0.04218103,-0.02533753,-0.05775115,0.0336468,0.00163624,0.02112913,-0.044928,-0.03184929,0.04207675,-0.03985633,0.07111501,-0.00380644,0.03738082,0.01162922,0.00401788,0.02162407,0.16535211,-0.00193701,-0.01156277,0.03384121,0.00143515,0.06445008,0.0438587,0.05859838,0.00931191,-0.03519572,0.03238805,-0.05242458,-0.01411801,0.04569905,-0.01296392,0.01099572,0.00228517,-0.01493167,-0.0570689,0.00957646,0.02049437,0.03757271,0.02797639,-0.12120114,-0.00699228,-0.03330434,0.01314175,-0.03115463,-0.08455961,-0.00991873,-0.01728666,0.03064754,0.05966444,0.04267824,0.04199933,0.00838257,-0.08316354,-0.02056286,0.02070653,-0.05051562,0.07197597,0.06047679,0.00984007],"last_embed":{"hash":"131rahf","tokens":437}}},"last_read":{"hash":"131rahf","at":1774580774550},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1773447493307,"size":6305,"at":1774579779528,"hash":"131rahf"},"blocks":{"#Guia de Deployment - Áquila Pro Desktop\\n\\n## 📦 Build para Produção\\n\\n### Windows\\n\\n```bash\\n# Build da aplicação\\npnpm run build:electron\\n\\n# Criar instalador\\npnpm run dist:win\\n\\n# Resultado: aquila-pro-setup-1.0.0.exe\\n```\\n\\n### macOS\\n\\n```bash\\n# Build da aplicação\\npnpm run build:electron\\n\\n# Criar DMG\\npnpm run dist:mac\\n\\n# Resultado: Aquila-Pro-1.0.0.dmg\\n```\\n\\n### Linux\\n\\n```bash\\n# Build da aplicação\\npnpm run build:electron\\n\\n# Criar AppImage\\npnpm run dist:linux\\n\\n# Resultado: Aquila-Pro-1.0.0.AppImage\\n```\\n\\n## 🔧 Configuração de Produção\\n\\n### Variáveis de Ambiente\\n\\nCriar arquivo `.env.production`:\\n\\n```env\\n# Banco de Dados\\nDATABASE_URL=mysql://user:password@host:3306/aquila_pro\\nDATABASE_BACKUP_PATH=/opt/aquila-pro/backups\\n\\n# Segurança\\nENCRYPTION_KEY=your-secure-key-here\\nJWT_SECRET=your-jwt-secret-here\\nBCRYPT_ROUNDS=12\\n\\n# Processamento\\nMAX_CAMERAS=16\\nFRAME_SKIP=2\\nDETECTION_THRESHOLD=0.5\\nFACE_RECOGNITION_THRESHOLD=0.6\\n\\n# WebSocket\\nWS_PORT=9000\\nWS_MAX_CONNECTIONS=100\\n\\n# Logging\\nLOG_LEVEL=info\\nLOG_RETENTION_DAYS=30\\n\\n# Backup\\nBACKUP_INTERVAL_HOURS=24\\nBACKUP_RETENTION_DAYS=30\\n\\n# Notificações\\nSMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com\\nSMTP_PORT=587\\nSMTP_USER=your-email@gmail.com\\nSMTP_PASSWORD=your-app-password\\n```\\n\\n## 🚀 Instalação em Servidor\\n\\n### Requisitos de Sistema\\n\\n**Windows Server 2019+**\\n- CPU: Intel i5 ou superior\\n- RAM: 8GB mínimo, 16GB recomendado\\n- Armazenamento: 100GB SSD\\n- GPU: NVIDIA com CUDA (opcional, para melhor performance)\\n\\n**Linux (Ubuntu 20.04+)**\\n- CPU: Intel i5 ou superior\\n- RAM: 8GB mínimo, 16GB recomendado\\n- Armazenamento: 100GB SSD\\n- GPU: NVIDIA com CUDA (opcional)\\n\\n### Instalação no Windows\\n\\n```powershell\\n# 1. Executar instalador\\n.\\\\aquila-pro-setup-1.0.0.exe\\n\\n# 2. Seguir wizard de instalação\\n# 3. Configurar banco de dados\\n# 4. Iniciar serviço\\nStart-Service AquilaPro\\n\\n# 5. Acessar dashboard\\n# http://localhost:3000\\n```\\n\\n### Instalação no Linux\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. Extrair AppImage\\nchmod +x Aquila-Pro-1.0.0.AppImage\\n./Aquila-Pro-1.0.0.AppImage --appimage-extract\\n\\n# 2. Instalar dependências\\nsudo apt-get install -y libssl-dev libffi-dev python3-dev\\npip install -r requirements.txt\\n\\n# 3. Criar serviço systemd\\nsudo cp aquila-pro.service /etc/systemd/system/\\nsudo systemctl daemon-reload\\nsudo systemctl enable aquila-pro\\nsudo systemctl start aquila-pro\\n\\n# 4. Verificar status\\nsudo systemctl status aquila-pro\\n```\\n\\n### Instalação no macOS\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. Montar DMG\\nhdiutil attach Aquila-Pro-1.0.0.dmg\\n\\n# 2. Copiar para Applications\\ncp -r /Volumes/Aquila-Pro/Aquila-Pro.app /Applications/\\n\\n# 3. Desmontar\\nhdiutil detach /Volumes/Aquila-Pro\\n\\n# 4. Executar\\nopen /Applications/Aquila-Pro.app\\n```\\n\\n## 🗄️ Configuração de Banco de Dados\\n\\n### MySQL\\n\\n```sql\\n-- Criar banco de dados\\nCREATE DATABASE aquila_pro CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- Criar usuário\\nCREATE USER 'aquila'@'localhost' IDENTIFIED BY 'secure-password';\\nGRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON aquila_pro.* TO 'aquila'@'localhost';\\nFLUSH PRIVILEGES;\\n\\n-- Importar schema\\nUSE aquila_pro;\\nSOURCE schema.sql;\\n```\\n\\n### SQLite (Desenvolvimento)\\n\\n```bash\\n# Banco é criado automaticamente em:\\n~/.config/AquilaPro/data.db\\n```\\n\\n## 📹 Configuração de Câmeras\\n\\n### Câmeras IP Suportadas\\n\\n- Hikvision\\n- Dahua\\n- Uniview\\n- Axis\\n- Sony\\n- Panasonic\\n\\n### URLs RTSP Comuns\\n\\n```\\n# Hikvision\\nrtsp://admin:password@192.168.1.100:554/Streaming/Channels/101\\n\\n# Dahua\\nrtsp://admin:password@192.168.1.100:554/stream/ch00_0\\n\\n# Uniview\\nrtsp://admin:password@192.168.1.100:554/stream/ch0\\n\\n# Axis\\nrtsp://admin:password@192.168.1.100:554/axis-media/media.amp\\n```\\n\\n## 🔒 Segurança em Produção\\n\\n### Firewall\\n\\n```bash\\n# Abrir portas necessárias\\nsudo ufw allow 3000/tcp  # Dashboard\\nsudo ufw allow 9000/tcp  # WebSocket\\nsudo ufw allow 554/tcp   # RTSP (câmeras)\\n```\\n\\n### SSL/TLS\\n\\n```bash\\n# Gerar certificado auto-assinado\\nopenssl req -x509 -newkey rsa:4096 -keyout key.pem -out cert.pem -days 365\\n\\n# Configurar no Electron\\n# Ver: electron/src/main.ts\\n```\\n\\n### Backup Automático\\n\\n```bash\\n# Configurar cron job\\ncrontab -e\\n\\n# Adicionar linha:\\n0 2 * * * /opt/aquila-pro/backup.sh\\n```\\n\\n## 📊 Monitoramento\\n\\n### Logs\\n\\n```bash\\n# Windows\\nC:\\\\Users\\\\{user}\\\\AppData\\\\Roaming\\\\AquilaPro\\\\logs\\n\\n# Linux\\n~/.config/AquilaPro/logs\\n\\n# macOS\\n~/Library/Application Support/AquilaPro/logs\\n```\\n\\n### Métricas\\n\\n```bash\\n# Acessar dashboard de métricas\\nhttp://localhost:3000/metrics\\n\\n# Exportar em Prometheus\\nhttp://localhost:9090/metrics\\n```\\n\\n## 🔄 Atualizações\\n\\n### Verificar Atualizações\\n\\n```bash\\n# Automático (a cada 24 horas)\\n# Ou manual via Settings > About > Check for Updates\\n```\\n\\n### Atualizar Manualmente\\n\\n```bash\\n# Windows\\nwget https://releases.aquilapro.com.br/aquila-pro-1.1.0.exe\\n.\\\\aquila-pro-1.1.0.exe\\n\\n# Linux\\nwget https://releases.aquilapro.com.br/Aquila-Pro-1.1.0.AppImage\\nchmod +x Aquila-Pro-1.1.0.AppImage\\n./Aquila-Pro-1.1.0.AppImage\\n```\\n\\n## 🆘 Troubleshooting\\n\\n### Aplicação não inicia\\n\\n```bash\\n# Verificar logs\\ncat ~/.config/AquilaPro/logs/app-*.log\\n\\n# Limpar cache\\nrm -rf ~/.config/AquilaPro/cache\\n\\n# Reiniciar\\n```\\n\\n### Câmeras desconectam\\n\\n```bash\\n# Verificar conectividade\\nping 192.168.1.100\\n\\n# Testar RTSP\\nffmpeg -rtsp_transport tcp -i rtsp://url -t 5 -f null -\\n\\n# Aumentar timeout\\n# Settings > Camera > Connection Timeout\\n```\\n\\n### Performance baixa\\n\\n```bash\\n# Verificar recursos\\ntop  # Linux\\nTask Manager  # Windows\\n\\n# Reduzir número de câmeras\\n# Reduzir resolução\\n# Aumentar intervalo de processamento\\n```\\n\\n## 📞 Suporte\\n\\n- Email: support@aquilapro.com.br\\n- Telefone: +55 (11) 3000-0000\\n- Chat: https://aquilapro.com.br/chat\\n- Documentação: https://docs.aquilapro.com.br\\n\\n## 📋 Checklist de Deployment\\n\\n- [ ] Banco de dados configurado\\n- [ ] Variáveis de ambiente definidas\\n- [ ] Certificado SSL instalado\\n- [ ] Câmeras testadas e conectadas\\n- [ ] Backup automático ativo\\n- [ ] Logs sendo coletados\\n- [ ] Monitoramento configurado\\n- [ ] Usuários criados\\n- [ ] Testes de funcionalidade completos\\n- [ ] Documentação atualizada\\n":[1,2]},"outlinks":[],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"131rahf","at":1774580774433}},"smart_blocks:docs/DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md#Guia de Deployment - Áquila Pro Desktop\\n\\n## 📦 Build para Produção\\n\\n### Windows\\n\\n```bash\\n# Build da aplicação\\npnpm run build:electron\\n\\n# Criar instalador\\npnpm run dist:win\\n\\n# Resultado: aquila-pro-setup-1.0.0.exe\\n```\\n\\n### macOS\\n\\n```bash\\n# Build da aplicação\\npnpm run build:electron\\n\\n# Criar DMG\\npnpm run dist:mac\\n\\n# Resultado: Aquila-Pro-1.0.0.dmg\\n```\\n\\n### Linux\\n\\n```bash\\n# Build da aplicação\\npnpm run build:electron\\n\\n# Criar AppImage\\npnpm run dist:linux\\n\\n# Resultado: Aquila-Pro-1.0.0.AppImage\\n```\\n\\n## 🔧 Configuração de Produção\\n\\n### Variáveis de Ambiente\\n\\nCriar arquivo `.env.production`:\\n\\n```env\\n# Banco de Dados\\nDATABASE_URL=mysql://user:password@host:3306/aquila_pro\\nDATABASE_BACKUP_PATH=/opt/aquila-pro/backups\\n\\n# Segurança\\nENCRYPTION_KEY=your-secure-key-here\\nJWT_SECRET=your-jwt-secret-here\\nBCRYPT_ROUNDS=12\\n\\n# Processamento\\nMAX_CAMERAS=16\\nFRAME_SKIP=2\\nDETECTION_THRESHOLD=0.5\\nFACE_RECOGNITION_THRESHOLD=0.6\\n\\n# WebSocket\\nWS_PORT=9000\\nWS_MAX_CONNECTIONS=100\\n\\n# Logging\\nLOG_LEVEL=info\\nLOG_RETENTION_DAYS=30\\n\\n# Backup\\nBACKUP_INTERVAL_HOURS=24\\nBACKUP_RETENTION_DAYS=30\\n\\n# Notificações\\nSMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com\\nSMTP_PORT=587\\nSMTP_USER=your-email@gmail.com\\nSMTP_PASSWORD=your-app-password\\n```\\n\\n## 🚀 Instalação em Servidor\\n\\n### Requisitos de Sistema\\n\\n**Windows Server 2019+**\\n- CPU: Intel i5 ou superior\\n- RAM: 8GB mínimo, 16GB recomendado\\n- Armazenamento: 100GB SSD\\n- GPU: NVIDIA com CUDA (opcional, para melhor performance)\\n\\n**Linux (Ubuntu 20.04+)**\\n- CPU: Intel i5 ou superior\\n- RAM: 8GB mínimo, 16GB recomendado\\n- Armazenamento: 100GB SSD\\n- GPU: NVIDIA com CUDA (opcional)\\n\\n### Instalação no Windows\\n\\n```powershell\\n# 1. Executar instalador\\n.\\\\aquila-pro-setup-1.0.0.exe\\n\\n# 2. Seguir wizard de instalação\\n# 3. Configurar banco de dados\\n# 4. Iniciar serviço\\nStart-Service AquilaPro\\n\\n# 5. Acessar dashboard\\n# http://localhost:3000\\n```\\n\\n### Instalação no Linux\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. Extrair AppImage\\nchmod +x Aquila-Pro-1.0.0.AppImage\\n./Aquila-Pro-1.0.0.AppImage --appimage-extract\\n\\n# 2. Instalar dependências\\nsudo apt-get install -y libssl-dev libffi-dev python3-dev\\npip install -r requirements.txt\\n\\n# 3. Criar serviço systemd\\nsudo cp aquila-pro.service /etc/systemd/system/\\nsudo systemctl daemon-reload\\nsudo systemctl enable aquila-pro\\nsudo systemctl start aquila-pro\\n\\n# 4. Verificar status\\nsudo systemctl status aquila-pro\\n```\\n\\n### Instalação no macOS\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. Montar DMG\\nhdiutil attach Aquila-Pro-1.0.0.dmg\\n\\n# 2. Copiar para Applications\\ncp -r /Volumes/Aquila-Pro/Aquila-Pro.app /Applications/\\n\\n# 3. Desmontar\\nhdiutil detach /Volumes/Aquila-Pro\\n\\n# 4. Executar\\nopen /Applications/Aquila-Pro.app\\n```\\n\\n## 🗄️ Configuração de Banco de Dados\\n\\n### MySQL\\n\\n```sql\\n-- Criar banco de dados\\nCREATE DATABASE aquila_pro CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- Criar usuário\\nCREATE USER 'aquila'@'localhost' IDENTIFIED BY 'secure-password';\\nGRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON aquila_pro.* TO 'aquila'@'localhost';\\nFLUSH PRIVILEGES;\\n\\n-- Importar schema\\nUSE aquila_pro;\\nSOURCE schema.sql;\\n```\\n\\n### SQLite (Desenvolvimento)\\n\\n```bash\\n# Banco é criado automaticamente em:\\n~/.config/AquilaPro/data.db\\n```\\n\\n## 📹 Configuração de Câmeras\\n\\n### Câmeras IP Suportadas\\n\\n- Hikvision\\n- Dahua\\n- Uniview\\n- Axis\\n- Sony\\n- Panasonic\\n\\n### URLs RTSP Comuns\\n\\n```\\n# Hikvision\\nrtsp://admin:password@192.168.1.100:554/Streaming/Channels/101\\n\\n# Dahua\\nrtsp://admin:password@192.168.1.100:554/stream/ch00_0\\n\\n# Uniview\\nrtsp://admin:password@192.168.1.100:554/stream/ch0\\n\\n# Axis\\nrtsp://admin:password@192.168.1.100:554/axis-media/media.amp\\n```\\n\\n## 🔒 Segurança em Produção\\n\\n### Firewall\\n\\n```bash\\n# Abrir portas necessárias\\nsudo ufw allow 3000/tcp  # Dashboard\\nsudo ufw allow 9000/tcp  # WebSocket\\nsudo ufw allow 554/tcp   # RTSP (câmeras)\\n```\\n\\n### SSL/TLS\\n\\n```bash\\n# Gerar certificado auto-assinado\\nopenssl req -x509 -newkey rsa:4096 -keyout key.pem -out cert.pem -days 365\\n\\n# Configurar no Electron\\n# Ver: electron/src/main.ts\\n```\\n\\n### Backup Automático\\n\\n```bash\\n# Configurar cron job\\ncrontab -e\\n\\n# Adicionar linha:\\n0 2 * * * /opt/aquila-pro/backup.sh\\n```\\n\\n## 📊 Monitoramento\\n\\n### Logs\\n\\n```bash\\n# Windows\\nC:\\\\Users\\\\{user}\\\\AppData\\\\Roaming\\\\AquilaPro\\\\logs\\n\\n# Linux\\n~/.config/AquilaPro/logs\\n\\n# macOS\\n~/Library/Application Support/AquilaPro/logs\\n```\\n\\n### Métricas\\n\\n```bash\\n# Acessar dashboard de métricas\\nhttp://localhost:3000/metrics\\n\\n# Exportar em Prometheus\\nhttp://localhost:9090/metrics\\n```\\n\\n## 🔄 Atualizações\\n\\n### Verificar Atualizações\\n\\n```bash\\n# Automático (a cada 24 horas)\\n# Ou manual via Settings > About > Check for Updates\\n```\\n\\n### Atualizar Manualmente\\n\\n```bash\\n# Windows\\nwget https://releases.aquilapro.com.br/aquila-pro-1.1.0.exe\\n.\\\\aquila-pro-1.1.0.exe\\n\\n# Linux\\nwget https://releases.aquilapro.com.br/Aquila-Pro-1.1.0.AppImage\\nchmod +x Aquila-Pro-1.1.0.AppImage\\n./Aquila-Pro-1.1.0.AppImage\\n```\\n\\n## 🆘 Troubleshooting\\n\\n### Aplicação não inicia\\n\\n```bash\\n# Verificar logs\\ncat ~/.config/AquilaPro/logs/app-*.log\\n\\n# Limpar cache\\nrm -rf ~/.config/AquilaPro/cache\\n\\n# Reiniciar\\n```\\n\\n### Câmeras desconectam\\n\\n```bash\\n# Verificar conectividade\\nping 192.168.1.100\\n\\n# Testar RTSP\\nffmpeg -rtsp_transport tcp -i rtsp://url -t 5 -f null -\\n\\n# Aumentar timeout\\n# Settings > Camera > Connection Timeout\\n```\\n\\n### Performance baixa\\n\\n```bash\\n# Verificar recursos\\ntop  # Linux\\nTask Manager  # Windows\\n\\n# Reduzir número de câmeras\\n# Reduzir resolução\\n# Aumentar intervalo de processamento\\n```\\n\\n## 📞 Suporte\\n\\n- Email: support@aquilapro.com.br\\n- Telefone: +55 (11) 3000-0000\\n- Chat: https://aquilapro.com.br/chat\\n- Documentação: https://docs.aquilapro.com.br\\n\\n## 📋 Checklist de Deployment\\n\\n- [ ] Banco de dados configurado\\n- [ ] Variáveis de ambiente definidas\\n- [ ] Certificado SSL instalado\\n- [ ] Câmeras testadas e conectadas\\n- [ ] Backup automático ativo\\n- [ ] Logs sendo coletados\\n- [ ] Monitoramento configurado\\n- [ ] Usuários criados\\n- [ ] Testes de funcionalidade completos\\n- [ ] Documentação atualizada\\n": {"path":null,"embedd