5195898,0.01530808,-0.03445927,0.04409048,-0.05855858,-0.02193665,0.0493576,-0.01716254,0.01073146,0.00333386,-0.01949576,-0.05972151,0.01572829,0.01508986,0.03179674,0.03430767,-0.12244983,-0.00284621,-0.03173194,0.01440451,-0.03677666,-0.07284205,-0.01237158,-0.01532393,0.03109998,0.06384353,0.03591599,0.03554488,0.01249999,-0.07960512,-0.02522393,0.01461778,-0.03908771,0.07627917,0.05628143,0.0024425],"last_embed":{"hash":"131rahf","tokens":436}}},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"131rahf","at":1774580774550},"key":"docs/DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md#Guia de Deployment - Áquila Pro Desktop\\n\\n## 📦 Build para Produção\\n\\n### Windows\\n\\n```bash\\n# Build da aplicação\\npnpm run build:electron\\n\\n# Criar instalador\\npnpm run dist:win\\n\\n# Resultado: aquila-pro-setup-1.0.0.exe\\n```\\n\\n### macOS\\n\\n```bash\\n# Build da aplicação\\npnpm run build:electron\\n\\n# Criar DMG\\npnpm run dist:mac\\n\\n# Resultado: Aquila-Pro-1.0.0.dmg\\n```\\n\\n### Linux\\n\\n```bash\\n# Build da aplicação\\npnpm run build:electron\\n\\n# Criar AppImage\\npnpm run dist:linux\\n\\n# Resultado: Aquila-Pro-1.0.0.AppImage\\n```\\n\\n## 🔧 Configuração de Produção\\n\\n### Variáveis de Ambiente\\n\\nCriar arquivo `.env.production`:\\n\\n```env\\n# Banco de Dados\\nDATABASE_URL=mysql://user:password@host:3306/aquila_pro\\nDATABASE_BACKUP_PATH=/opt/aquila-pro/backups\\n\\n# Segurança\\nENCRYPTION_KEY=your-secure-key-here\\nJWT_SECRET=your-jwt-secret-here\\nBCRYPT_ROUNDS=12\\n\\n# Processamento\\nMAX_CAMERAS=16\\nFRAME_SKIP=2\\nDETECTION_THRESHOLD=0.5\\nFACE_RECOGNITION_THRESHOLD=0.6\\n\\n# WebSocket\\nWS_PORT=9000\\nWS_MAX_CONNECTIONS=100\\n\\n# Logging\\nLOG_LEVEL=info\\nLOG_RETENTION_DAYS=30\\n\\n# Backup\\nBACKUP_INTERVAL_HOURS=24\\nBACKUP_RETENTION_DAYS=30\\n\\n# Notificações\\nSMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com\\nSMTP_PORT=587\\nSMTP_USER=your-email@gmail.com\\nSMTP_PASSWORD=your-app-password\\n```\\n\\n## 🚀 Instalação em Servidor\\n\\n### Requisitos de Sistema\\n\\n**Windows Server 2019+**\\n- CPU: Intel i5 ou superior\\n- RAM: 8GB mínimo, 16GB recomendado\\n- Armazenamento: 100GB SSD\\n- GPU: NVIDIA com CUDA (opcional, para melhor performance)\\n\\n**Linux (Ubuntu 20.04+)**\\n- CPU: Intel i5 ou superior\\n- RAM: 8GB mínimo, 16GB recomendado\\n- Armazenamento: 100GB SSD\\n- GPU: NVIDIA com CUDA (opcional)\\n\\n### Instalação no Windows\\n\\n```powershell\\n# 1. Executar instalador\\n.\\\\aquila-pro-setup-1.0.0.exe\\n\\n# 2. Seguir wizard de instalação\\n# 3. Configurar banco de dados\\n# 4. Iniciar serviço\\nStart-Service AquilaPro\\n\\n# 5. Acessar dashboard\\n# http://localhost:3000\\n```\\n\\n### Instalação no Linux\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. Extrair AppImage\\nchmod +x Aquila-Pro-1.0.0.AppImage\\n./Aquila-Pro-1.0.0.AppImage --appimage-extract\\n\\n# 2. Instalar dependências\\nsudo apt-get install -y libssl-dev libffi-dev python3-dev\\npip install -r requirements.txt\\n\\n# 3. Criar serviço systemd\\nsudo cp aquila-pro.service /etc/systemd/system/\\nsudo systemctl daemon-reload\\nsudo systemctl enable aquila-pro\\nsudo systemctl start aquila-pro\\n\\n# 4. Verificar status\\nsudo systemctl status aquila-pro\\n```\\n\\n### Instalação no macOS\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. Montar DMG\\nhdiutil attach Aquila-Pro-1.0.0.dmg\\n\\n# 2. Copiar para Applications\\ncp -r /Volumes/Aquila-Pro/Aquila-Pro.app /Applications/\\n\\n# 3. Desmontar\\nhdiutil detach /Volumes/Aquila-Pro\\n\\n# 4. Executar\\nopen /Applications/Aquila-Pro.app\\n```\\n\\n## 🗄️ Configuração de Banco de Dados\\n\\n### MySQL\\n\\n```sql\\n-- Criar banco de dados\\nCREATE DATABASE aquila_pro CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci;\\n\\n-- Criar usuário\\nCREATE USER 'aquila'@'localhost' IDENTIFIED BY 'secure-password';\\nGRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON aquila_pro.* TO 'aquila'@'localhost';\\nFLUSH PRIVILEGES;\\n\\n-- Importar schema\\nUSE aquila_pro;\\nSOURCE schema.sql;\\n```\\n\\n### SQLite (Desenvolvimento)\\n\\n```bash\\n# Banco é criado automaticamente em:\\n~/.config/AquilaPro/data.db\\n```\\n\\n## 📹 Configuração de Câmeras\\n\\n### Câmeras IP Suportadas\\n\\n- Hikvision\\n- Dahua\\n- Uniview\\n- Axis\\n- Sony\\n- Panasonic\\n\\n### URLs RTSP Comuns\\n\\n```\\n# Hikvision\\nrtsp://admin:password@192.168.1.100:554/Streaming/Channels/101\\n\\n# Dahua\\nrtsp://admin:password@192.168.1.100:554/stream/ch00_0\\n\\n# Uniview\\nrtsp://admin:password@192.168.1.100:554/stream/ch0\\n\\n# Axis\\nrtsp://admin:password@192.168.1.100:554/axis-media/media.amp\\n```\\n\\n## 🔒 Segurança em Produção\\n\\n### Firewall\\n\\n```bash\\n# Abrir portas necessárias\\nsudo ufw allow 3000/tcp  # Dashboard\\nsudo ufw allow 9000/tcp  # WebSocket\\nsudo ufw allow 554/tcp   # RTSP (câmeras)\\n```\\n\\n### SSL/TLS\\n\\n```bash\\n# Gerar certificado auto-assinado\\nopenssl req -x509 -newkey rsa:4096 -keyout key.pem -out cert.pem -days 365\\n\\n# Configurar no Electron\\n# Ver: electron/src/main.ts\\n```\\n\\n### Backup Automático\\n\\n```bash\\n# Configurar cron job\\ncrontab -e\\n\\n# Adicionar linha:\\n0 2 * * * /opt/aquila-pro/backup.sh\\n```\\n\\n## 📊 Monitoramento\\n\\n### Logs\\n\\n```bash\\n# Windows\\nC:\\\\Users\\\\{user}\\\\AppData\\\\Roaming\\\\AquilaPro\\\\logs\\n\\n# Linux\\n~/.config/AquilaPro/logs\\n\\n# macOS\\n~/Library/Application Support/AquilaPro/logs\\n```\\n\\n### Métricas\\n\\n```bash\\n# Acessar dashboard de métricas\\nhttp://localhost:3000/metrics\\n\\n# Exportar em Prometheus\\nhttp://localhost:9090/metrics\\n```\\n\\n## 🔄 Atualizações\\n\\n### Verificar Atualizações\\n\\n```bash\\n# Automático (a cada 24 horas)\\n# Ou manual via Settings > About > Check for Updates\\n```\\n\\n### Atualizar Manualmente\\n\\n```bash\\n# Windows\\nwget https://releases.aquilapro.com.br/aquila-pro-1.1.0.exe\\n.\\\\aquila-pro-1.1.0.exe\\n\\n# Linux\\nwget https://releases.aquilapro.com.br/Aquila-Pro-1.1.0.AppImage\\nchmod +x Aquila-Pro-1.1.0.AppImage\\n./Aquila-Pro-1.1.0.AppImage\\n```\\n\\n## 🆘 Troubleshooting\\n\\n### Aplicação não inicia\\n\\n```bash\\n# Verificar logs\\ncat ~/.config/AquilaPro/logs/app-*.log\\n\\n# Limpar cache\\nrm -rf ~/.config/AquilaPro/cache\\n\\n# Reiniciar\\n```\\n\\n### Câmeras desconectam\\n\\n```bash\\n# Verificar conectividade\\nping 192.168.1.100\\n\\n# Testar RTSP\\nffmpeg -rtsp_transport tcp -i rtsp://url -t 5 -f null -\\n\\n# Aumentar timeout\\n# Settings > Camera > Connection Timeout\\n```\\n\\n### Performance baixa\\n\\n```bash\\n# Verificar recursos\\ntop  # Linux\\nTask Manager  # Windows\\n\\n# Reduzir número de câmeras\\n# Reduzir resolução\\n# Aumentar intervalo de processamento\\n```\\n\\n## 📞 Suporte\\n\\n- Email: support@aquilapro.com.br\\n- Telefone: +55 (11) 3000-0000\\n- Chat: https://aquilapro.com.br/chat\\n- Documentação: https://docs.aquilapro.com.br\\n\\n## 📋 Checklist de Deployment\\n\\n- [ ] Banco de dados configurado\\n- [ ] Variáveis de ambiente definidas\\n- [ ] Certificado SSL instalado\\n- [ ] Câmeras testadas e conectadas\\n- [ ] Backup automático ativo\\n- [ ] Logs sendo coletados\\n- [ ] Monitoramento configurado\\n- [ ] Usuários criados\\n- [ ] Testes de funcionalidade completos\\n- [ ] Documentação atualizada\\n","lines":[1,2],"size":6212,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock","last_embed":{"hash":"131rahf","at":1774580774550}},
